OL,3,GNEWSAGold medallist encourages people
OL,4,Ato try bowls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Commonwealth Games medallist and
OL,7,Fmembers of a Kent bowls club are
OL,8,Fencouraging more people to try the
OL,9,Fsport, describing it as welcoming,
OL,10,Fsocial and "life-changing".
OL,12,FSian Honnor, who won three gold and two
OL,13,Fbronze medals at the Commonwealth
OL,14,FGames, said bowls offered opportunities
OL,15,Ffor people of all ages and abilities at
OL,16,Fthe Oyster Indoor Bowls Club in
OL,17,FWhitstable.
OL,19,FThe former Team England flagbearer took
OL,20,Fup the sport more than 30 years ago
OL,21,Fafter being introduced to it by her
OL,22,Fgrandparents.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
