OL,3,GNEWSAGold medallist encourages people
OL,4,Ato try bowls
OL,5,
OL,6,FClub member Darren said bowls had
OL,7,Fhelped him return to sport after an
OL,8,Finjury. "This has certainly changed my
OL,9,Flife," he said.
